Subject: wasmedge call indirect canonical type id fast path

Rebased onto 0.17.2-rc.3: upstream #4920 hoisted retrieveFuncRef() above
the type check and added an UninitializedElement null check, so the
fast path now reuses that FuncInst instead of re-deriving it; the two
header conflicts are #4850 comment rewording only.
